---
description: Zod at trust boundaries — parse unknown input before core
globs: **/*.{ts,tsx}
alwaysApply: false
---

# Zod validation

- Any **`unknown`** / JSON / form / webhook / searchParams → **parse with Zod** at the boundary (route, Server Action, adapter translating external payloads).
- Export **`z.infer<typeof Schema>`** types alongside schemas in domain/application modules when they define wire formats.
- Prefer **`.safeParse`** + explicit error mapping for UX; reserve `.parse` for internal invariants where failure should throw.
- Do not widen validated data back to `any`; thread inferred types through functions.
- Colocate domain-centric schemas with domain (`*-zod.ts` pattern already used in this repo).
